{
 "v": 1,
 "about": "Wallet rules, pure. params = the server's play config for the case (defaults: day_max 8, start 10; the owner may set day_max 1-24 and start 0-50; every other value is fixed in v1); a case that changes one names only that key in its params. create = a new wallet opens with params.start. holdings = everything the person has on this server (wallet + chips at a table + escrow). cap = 100 + 50 x rank. tick = one run of the server's call sampler; gap_s = now minus that wallet's credited_through (the time it was last sampled). If eligible, not at the cap and under the day max, add min(gap_s, tick_max_s) to accrual_s; at chip_s (3600) pay one chip and keep the rest. The day (for the day max and the top-up) is the calendar day in the server's time zone (params.tz); a new day resets earned_today before the tick is judged. topup: only when holdings is exactly 0 and the last top-up was on another day -> holdings = topup_to. settle = a game moved chips (delta). leave = the person left a game with nothing still in play: holdings >= cap -> holdings = prestige_to, rank + 1 (once). A new wallet starts at params.start.",
